Phone Use

phone_browser follows approaches published by these projects; no code is copied from them:
- browser-use (MIT) - numbered interactive elements and a compact text view of the page
- chrome-devtools-mcp (Apache-2.0, Google) - accessibility-style snapshot with element handles,
  Chrome DevTools Protocol over adb forward on Android
- Playwright MCP / Playwright Android support (Apache-2.0, Microsoft) - ref-based actions,
  devtools socket discovery from /proc/net/unix
